# Repository files that must not be served as part of the site.
#
# assets.directory is the repository root, so anything NOT listed here is
# reachable over HTTP. wrangler has no default excludes of its own — .git/
# included — so this list is the only thing keeping repository internals
# off the air. .gh-workflows/ is where the deploy workflows check out the
# shared actions; it must never be uploaded. .well-known/ is deliberately
# absent — it carries security.txt (RFC 9116) and is meant to be public.
.git/
.gh-workflows/
.github
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
node_modules/
README.md
AGENTS.md
justfile
scripts/
